   00:54:45 [a] follower, c leads (term 1)
   00:54:45 [c] job ran, term 1
   00:54:45 [b] started (pid 12727), lease TTL 3s, renew every 1s
   00:54:45 [b] follower, c leads (term 1)
   00:54:46 [c] job ran, term 1
   00:54:47 [c] job ran, term 1
